323a7b371e478a601d65ae2f2c02", "node_id": "C_kwDOAA1TcNoAKDJkODc2MjFmNWY1MjMyM2E3YjM3MWU0NzhhNjAxZDY1YWUyZjJjMDI", "commit": {"author": {"name": "Zach Collins", "email": "recursive.cookie.jar@gmail.com", "date": "2023-02-28T19:29:34Z"}, "committer": {"name": "GitHub", "email": "noreply@github.com", "date": "2023-02-28T19:29:34Z"}, "message": "chore(hybrid-cloud): Break queries that depend on cross silo FKs (#45095)\n\nSeparating out the query changes from\r\nhttps://github.com/getsentry/sentry/pull/44595/files\r\n\r\nHybrid Cloud needs to break many foreign key relationships that depend\r\non cross silo models. To support this, we have a new column which acts\r\nmerely as a big int referencing identifiers, but uses a eventually\r\nconsistent system to cascade or set null when deletions happen across\r\nsilos.\r\n\r\nThis PR first changes all known api and test usages of several cross\r\nsilo foreign keys in preparation for the migration that actually breaks\r\nthose foreign keys. Several more to come.", "tree": {"sha": "124c0ca6fa35b9581eadb50e17fc36b1a222773e", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry/git/trees/124c0ca6fa35b9581eadb50e17fc36b1a222773e"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry/git/commits/2d87621f5f52323a7b371e478a601d65ae2f2c02", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": true, "reason": "valid", "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsBcBAABCAAQBQJj/lYeCRBK7hj4Ov3rIwAAdsoIAAbUPZPOhj0vjSVrhmFZajmQ\nZYlVTgW4Q1O3l+uOraQPY08UYOHjwo2f4iRCWBa5GY35FD23fXhY9epKk6axnqzh\nnRW8XvrH0ITN6awGD0otsMEsFEYv8PEbZ0w3OelGW0Ahz9i4SNBzPaROl7rt4w+W\nHydoBt91uQXJhTgnraIgZx+UAeCAhUxkF+FeaEogYjZYaoSMEdOvoymfi5pY9S8G\nhUXGPI9+NDXBS2x8Zs/G2IuFF8hEWSRx+GBcNqMkjRubvoS3D5i5oOOruc/y5tVm\nEQtvCm85EvbOMBfcaRRT33RlPZpVqUUWn8vApkpVIirrqMSGDPmnRfYMT6OVTR8=\n=Dx4r\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n", "payload": "tree 124c0ca6fa35b9581eadb50e17fc36b1a222773e\nparent d546626a5eedc742af7c4a781a424ac858a32dc4\nauthor Zach Collins <recursive.cookie.ja